# NAME: TikTok-Extra
# FORMAT: Loon Remote Rule (.lsr)
# DESC: TikTok CDN 補充（ttcdn／ttlivecdn 等）
# 建議策略: 🇹🇼 Taiwan
# UPDATED: 2026-11-02 (Asia/Hong_Kong)
# TOTAL: 5
# SOURCES:
#   - 由 Clash 配置內聯域名規則抽出
# CHANGELOG:
#   - 2026-11-02: 初版；供 Clash RULE-SET／Loon Remote Rule／Shadowrocket RULE-SET
#   - 2026-11-02: 獨立主題，方便主配置行台灣；唔改現有 Tiktok 集

DOMAIN-KEYWORD,-tiktokcdn-com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ttcdn-us.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ttlivecdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ttoverseaus.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ttwstatic.com
